# The repository root IS the site, so everything here would otherwise be
# published. Keep the deployment to what a visitor should be able to reach.
#
# Everything that is kept but never served lives under exactly two folders, so
# a new internal file is excluded by where it is put rather than by remembering
# to add a line here. tools/verify_site.mjs asserts that both are 404 on the
# deployed site.

# archive/old3        - the site the v4 design import replaced (September 2026),
#                       moved with `git mv` so the history follows.
# archive/site-apache - the site that was live on the Apache webspace until the
#                       move to Vercel. SOURCE OF RECORD for the reviewed legal
#                       wording and for the old contact page.
# archive/site-v3     - the site that was live until the 2026 relaunch.
#                       None of them may be reachable, or a search engine finds
#                       a second, older copy of the same company.
archive/

# Internal: the audit findings, the design notes, the parked exports, the screen
# recordings and source material. Kept, never served.
internal/

# Build and audit tooling, the local measuring server, and the session notes.
tools/
prodserve.py
HANDOFF.md
CHANGELOG.md
README.md
AGENTS.md

# The Claude Design export the whole site is BUILT FROM: 26 artboards, ~40 MB,
# and it contains a second copy of every headline on every page - shipping it
# would put the studio in competition with itself in the index. robots.txt
# disallows it as a second line of defence; this is the first.
mccain-design-system/

# Source material and screen recordings - large and never requested by a page.
*.mp4

# Local tooling state.
.mind/
.mcp.json
.recall/
node_modules/

# Build scratch - see .gitignore. Never deployed.
_dcbuild/
